OL,3,AEnergy bills to rise by 26% from
OL,4,AJanuary after gas prices surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnergy bills will soar by 26% for
OL,7,Fmillions of households in January after
OL,8,Fa surge in gas prices sparked by the
OL,9,FIran war.
OL,11,FRegulator Ofgem said typical bills will
OL,12,Fincrease by about #37 a month in the
OL,13,Ffirst three months of the new year,
OL,14,Falthough individual households costs
OL,15,Fwill depend on how much they use at the
OL,16,Fcoldest time of year, so it could be
OL,17,Fcloser to #60 extra a month in winter.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
