OL,3,AMen charged with trespass at Prince and
OL,4,APrincess of Wales's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged with trespass
OL,7,Fand intent to steal at the Prince and
OL,8,FPrincess of Wales's country home in
OL,9,FNorfolk.
OL,11,FPolice were called to Anmer Hall, on
OL,12,Fthe Sandringham estate, shortly before
OL,13,F18:00 GMT on Monday after reports of
OL,14,Fsuspicious activity.
OL,16,FMirgen Doku, 34, of Courtfield Gardens,
OL,17,FLondon, and Arilen Ndoci, 32, of no
OL,18,Ffixed address, have both been charged
OL,19,Fwith entering a dwelling with intent to
OL,20,Fsteal and trespassing on a protected
OL,21,Fsite, Norfolk Police said.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
